<title>USA: Whittaker Corp names Charles Barrantes CFO.</title>
<headline>Whittaker Corp names Charles Barrantes CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whittaker Corp said on Monday it named Charles Barrantes as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Barrantes was executive vice president and CFO at Thompson PBE Inc, a distributor of automotive aftermarket products.</p>
<p>The company did not detail what happened to its former chief financial officer and was not immediately available for further information.</p>
</text>
